WEBVTT

00:12:28.577 --> 00:12:30.579
so we need to keep it under review.

00:12:31.497 --> 00:12:34.750
And if right now,
we're feeling overwhelmed,

00:12:34.792 --> 00:12:37.503
then nobody said it would be easy,

00:12:37.503 --> 00:12:39.296
and neither is getting old.

00:12:40.214 --> 00:12:41.548
But we can't wait,

00:12:41.548 --> 00:12:42.883
because if we wait,

00:12:42.925 --> 00:12:45.594
we'll find out after
something has happened.

00:12:45.594 --> 00:12:47.429
Like my family did,

00:12:47.471 --> 00:12:50.015
or like Howard and Charlotte's family did.

00:12:51.141 --> 00:12:53.310
When I first meet with victims
of elder crime,

00:12:53.352 --> 00:12:55.020
it can feel really heavy.

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:58.857
They've taken a big blow
to their dignity and their self-respect.

00:12:58.899 --> 00:13:01.401
They tell me that they feel
tired and foolish,